[57.375001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[57.421202, "o", "Four kinds of document this lab maps controls to (catalog/frameworks.json)\r\n\r\nframework  NIST AI RMF 1.0 (NIST AI 100-1, Jan 2023) subcategories\r\n           voluntary: advice you choose from; nobody certifies you against it\r\n           28 items in this lab's catalogue · https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.100-1.pdf\r\n\r\nstandard   ISO/IEC 42001:2023, AI management system (clause level; Annex A reference controls come from your licensed copy)\r\n           certifiable: an accredited auditor can certify an organisation against it\r\n           7 items in this lab's catalogue · https://www.iso.org/standard/42001\r\n\r\nlaw        EU AI Act, Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by the Digital Omnibus on AI (2026)\r\n           binding where it applies, with fines; what applies depends on the system's purpose\r\n           13 items in this lab's catalogue · https://ai-act-service-desk.ec.europa.eu/en/ai-act-explorer\r\n\r\nchecklist  OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2026 and OWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications 2026\r\n           community lists of what most often goes wrong in code; free, no certificate\r\n           20 items in this lab's catalogue · https://genai.owasp.org/download/56857/\r\n\r\nprofile    NIST AI 600-1 (Generative AI Profile, July 2024): the 12 risks\r\n           a companion to the NIST framework for generative AI, with 12 named risks\r\n"]
