[101.029669, "o", "Evidence row E01 from first-draft/evidence-index.csv\r\n\r\n  control      C01\r\n  file         evidence/2026-10-20-m07-agent-controls-test.txt\r\n  owner        AppSec lead\r\n  collected    2026-10-20\r\n  sha256 then  cff000aa90b51c655c9d6b4f16ad73ac36b1559795a98156080b775b046ddccd   (written in the index)\r\n  sha256 now   cff000aa90b51c655c9d6b4f16ad73ac36b1559795a98156080b775b046ddccd   (same: unchanged since it was indexed)\r\n  age          4 days before the assessment on 2026-10-24 (the lab allows 90)\r\n"]
[101.029828, "o", "\r\n  first lines of the file (27 lines in all):\r\n  | # Evidence: output of 'make test' in labs/m07 (agent containment controls), copied below this header (only the\r\n  | # Collected for the TSG Helpdesk assessment. Re-run it yourself: cd labs/m07 && make test\r\n  | \r\n  | [PASS] audit: the hash chain verifies, and editing one line breaks it\r\n  | [PASS] detect: the unsafe run raises EGRESS-AFTER-UNTRUSTED naming the attachment\r\n  | [PASS] detect: a blocked hijack still raises BLOCKED-ATTEMPT, and no high alert\r\n"]
